13
00:00:50,783 --> 00:00:53,927
The radiologist reviews the images and AI findings, then confirms

14
00:00:53,927 --> 00:00:57,071
or edits the report. Final clinical interpretation remains with the

15
00:00:57,071 --> 00:01:00,215
